1
00:00:00,367 --> 00:00:02,787
(Sheldon:)It's really dark down here.

2
00:00:04,621 --> 00:00:06,661
[VOMITING]

3
00:00:07,165 --> 00:00:13,375
(Penny:)Oh, sweetie, you really can't hold
your liquor, can you?

4
00:00:13,588 --> 00:00:14,838
(Leonard:)I'm okay.

5
00:00:15,006 --> 00:00:19,966
(Leonard:)Just a little mouthwash
and then I'm gonna rock your world.

6
00:00:23,473 --> 00:00:25,393
[VOMITING]

7
00:00:25,851 --> 00:00:27,981
(Leonard:)Are you okay?

8
00:00:28,311 --> 00:00:30,311
[BOTH VOMITING]

9
00:00:35,444 --> 00:00:40,904
Oh. Toby, what did you do in a past life
to be so disgusting now?

10
00:00:41,408 --> 00:00:43,198
(Sheldon:)His name isn't Toby.

11
00:00:43,368 --> 00:00:45,498
(Sheldon:)Toby is an absurd name for a cricket.

12
00:00:45,662 --> 00:00:48,292
(Raj:)-What would you name him?
-An appropriate cricket name.

13
00:00:48,457 --> 00:00:50,627
(Sheldon:)For example, Jiminy.

14
00:00:51,334 --> 00:00:53,254
(Howard:)All right, Sheldon, here we go.

15
00:00:53,420 --> 00:00:55,920
(Howard:)Kleingast's Field Guide
to North American Insects.

16
00:00:56,089 --> 00:00:57,629
(Howard:)Hey, Toby.

17
00:00:58,759 --> 00:01:00,219
(Howard:)Right here.

